1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 5=

3
00:00:16,658 --> 00:00:17,658
Move.

4
00:00:18,299 --> 00:00:19,379
Hurry up.

5
00:00:23,139 --> 00:00:24,139
Hurry up.

6
00:00:24,578 --> 00:00:25,859
Line up over here. Just closer.

7
00:00:25,939 --> 00:00:26,878
Go over there.

8
00:00:31,938 --> 00:00:33,618
They are the first batch.

9
00:00:33,699 --> 00:00:35,618
More newcomers will be here soon.

10
00:00:36,179 --> 00:00:37,179
Ruxue,

11
00:00:37,179 --> 00:00:38,298
you need to train them.

12
00:00:38,298 --> 00:00:40,019
Get them ready as soon as possible.

13
00:00:40,379 --> 00:00:42,019
Okay. Just leave it to me.

14
00:00:43,858 --> 00:00:45,138
What are you standing around for?

15
00:00:45,379 --> 00:00:46,379
Follow me.

16
00:00:48,619 --> 00:00:49,619
Hurry up.

17
00:00:50,939 --> 00:00:51,939
Su Yunian.

18
00:01:01,939 --> 00:01:03,019
F-Feng...

19
00:01:03,498 --> 00:01:05,138
You are An Ruoxi's sister,

20
00:01:05,619 --> 00:01:07,379
and Jiasheng cares about you,

21
00:01:07,778 --> 00:01:09,299
so I won't lay a finger on you.

22
00:01:09,699 --> 00:01:11,699
But I need you
to handle the guest receptions.

23
00:01:11,899 --> 00:01:14,339
From now on, the VIP guest lists
for all VIP rooms,

24
00:01:14,578 --> 00:01:16,619
as well as their schedules
and preferences,

25
00:01:16,899 --> 00:01:18,138
will be handled by you.

26
00:01:23,018 --> 00:01:24,018
I'll do my best.

27
00:01:24,418 --> 00:01:26,259
I like cooperative people.

28
00:01:34,424 --> 00:01:35,952
- Another round.
- Play it.

29
00:01:36,539 --> 00:01:38,658
The villa is across from the prison.

30
00:01:47,259 --> 00:01:48,259
Mr. Nie,

31
00:01:48,899 --> 00:01:49,899
hello.

32
00:01:51,138 --> 00:01:52,138
Don't worry.

33
00:01:52,179 --> 00:01:54,739
Xia Yuyan just put Tu Jiasheng
in solitary confinement for seven days.

34
00:01:56,099 --> 00:01:57,099
Right.

35
00:01:57,179 --> 00:01:58,459
It is far too lenient on him.

36
00:01:59,699 --> 00:02:00,858
However,

37
00:02:01,539 --> 00:02:02,899
he won't be comfortable for long.

38
00:02:03,218 --> 00:02:05,218
He's about to suffer soon.

39
00:02:31,739 --> 00:02:32,739
I am Lion.

40
00:02:39,339 --> 00:02:40,339
I am Tu Jiasheng.

41
00:02:51,818 --> 00:02:53,299
You took down Dalieba.

42
00:02:53,498 --> 00:02:54,698
He wasn't good enough.

43
00:02:54,899 --> 00:02:55,899
So I accept that.

44
00:02:55,938 --> 00:02:57,899
But you trashed Phachai and his men,

45
00:02:58,938 --> 00:02:59,938
and that made me happy.

46
00:03:00,619 --> 00:03:01,619
Hey.

47
00:03:02,339 --> 00:03:03,339
What are you talking about?

48
00:03:04,658 --> 00:03:05,739
Can't you understand it?

49
00:03:06,218 --> 00:03:07,218
Come here.

50
00:03:07,339 --> 00:03:09,258
Come here, let me teach you a lesson.

51
00:03:13,859 --> 00:03:14,859
You just wait.

52
00:03:28,538 --> 00:03:29,538
Tell me if there's anything.

53
00:03:50,218 --> 00:03:51,299
It is hardly up to you

54
00:03:52,498 --> 00:03:53,818
whether you fight.

55
00:03:55,818 --> 00:03:56,978
Have you lost your mind?

56
00:03:57,658 --> 00:03:59,739
I told you to teach them
how to please men.

57
00:03:59,859 --> 00:04:01,139
What on earth did you teach?

58
00:04:02,339 --> 00:04:04,459
Wine tasting, flower arrangement,

59
00:04:04,859 --> 00:04:05,859
and tea ceremonies?

60
00:04:06,179 --> 00:04:07,419
Keeping it classy, right?

61
00:04:07,619 --> 00:04:09,459
Are you defying me on purpose?

62
00:04:10,619 --> 00:04:12,218
Jiasheng used to train us like this...

63
00:04:14,098 --> 00:04:17,299
Prosperity belongs to Feng now!

64
00:04:17,619 --> 00:04:20,059
These girls are valuable to him.

65
00:04:20,579 --> 00:04:22,218
Listen to me carefully.

66
00:04:22,579 --> 00:04:23,859
I'm warning you.

67
00:04:24,139 --> 00:04:25,698
You'd better train them properly

68
00:04:25,698 --> 00:04:27,619
on how to please men.

69
00:04:28,299 --> 00:04:29,299
Otherwise,

70
00:04:29,619 --> 00:04:30,979
you know the consequences.

71
00:04:32,859 --> 00:04:33,859
I...

72
00:04:34,818 --> 00:04:36,539
Don't you know how to please a man?

73
00:04:37,698 --> 00:04:38,698
Fine.

74
00:04:38,859 --> 00:04:40,258
Tonight,

75
00:04:40,498 --> 00:04:43,698
I'll send Du Qiang to your room
to teach you properly.

76
00:04:44,018 --> 00:04:45,018
No, please don't!

77
00:04:45,578 --> 00:04:46,779
Learn properly, all of you!

78
00:04:54,378 --> 00:04:56,219
Tu Jiasheng asked me about Old Ghost.

79
00:04:57,018 --> 00:04:58,659
He even showed me an old photo of him

80
00:04:58,659 --> 00:04:59,659
and let me identify him.

81
00:04:59,779 --> 00:05:00,779
Keep watching him.

82
00:05:00,859 --> 00:05:02,018
Update me on everything.

83
00:05:03,378 --> 00:05:04,378
Captain Xia,

84
00:05:04,779 --> 00:05:06,338
about calling my mom...

85
00:05:07,779 --> 00:05:08,779
Follow me.

86
00:05:10,059 --> 00:05:11,979
It's up to me

87
00:05:12,739 --> 00:05:14,378
whether I want to fight
or who I want to fight.

88
00:05:20,938 --> 00:05:23,338
As long as you fight Tu Jiasheng,

89
00:05:23,779 --> 00:05:26,059
I can arrange for you
to stay at the villa for a week.

90
00:05:28,578 --> 00:05:29,659
I'm not interested in it.

91
00:05:30,179 --> 00:05:32,698
Your buddy Dalieba
is still in the hospital.

92
00:05:33,698 --> 00:05:35,779
His medication relies solely on my word.

93
00:05:36,219 --> 00:05:37,338
If the medication stops,

94
00:05:38,138 --> 00:05:39,698
he will be crippled for life,

95
00:05:41,258 --> 00:05:43,338
or he might not even survive.

96
00:05:44,818 --> 00:05:45,818
Don't you dare!

97
00:05:49,578 --> 00:05:50,578
Get up.

98
00:05:53,378 --> 00:05:55,018
How long has it been
since you saw your daughter?

99
00:05:55,539 --> 00:05:58,179
I heard she got admitted
to a great middle school.

100
00:05:58,498 --> 00:05:59,859
But you can't congratulate her.

101
00:06:01,739 --> 00:06:02,898
Isn't that a pity?

102
00:06:08,059 --> 00:06:09,219
As long as you fight,

103
00:06:10,739 --> 00:06:12,539
I can arrange a visit for tomorrow.

104
00:06:15,099 --> 00:06:16,099
Fight for real.

105
00:06:18,779 --> 00:06:19,979
If you cripple him,

106
00:06:20,898 --> 00:06:22,338
you will get three more visits.

107
00:06:23,299 --> 00:06:24,378
If you kill him,

108
00:06:25,338 --> 00:06:26,818
you will get regular monthly visits.

109
00:06:46,698 --> 00:06:47,698
Captain Xia,

110
00:06:48,338 --> 00:06:49,859
going through my belongings
without asking

111
00:06:50,338 --> 00:06:51,338
isn't appropriate, right?

112
00:06:51,419 --> 00:06:52,419
Where did you get this photo?

113
00:06:52,539 --> 00:06:53,979
I don't have to answer your question.

114
00:06:54,578 --> 00:06:56,099
Why did you come to Sea Breeze?

115
00:06:56,458 --> 00:06:57,698
What do you want with Old Ghost?

116
00:06:57,739 --> 00:06:58,739
Captain Xia,

117
00:06:58,818 --> 00:06:59,818
you seem quite anxious.

118
00:07:00,059 --> 00:07:01,578
Could you have some connection to him?

119
00:07:01,619 --> 00:07:03,539
- Answer my question!
- I want to ask you the same thing.

120
00:07:03,539 --> 00:07:04,619
You're watching my every move.

121
00:07:04,619 --> 00:07:05,859
Looks like you have a problem with me.

122
00:07:06,938 --> 00:07:07,938
Tu Jiasheng,

123
00:07:08,059 --> 00:07:09,498
back at Prosperity,

124
00:07:09,818 --> 00:07:11,018
how many girls did you ruin

125
00:07:11,179 --> 00:07:12,779
and how did you make your fortune?

126
00:07:13,138 --> 00:07:14,258
You know it best.

127
00:07:16,818 --> 00:07:17,818
You're just a prison guard.

128
00:07:18,578 --> 00:07:20,059
Why meddle in business
outside the prison?

129
00:07:23,378 --> 00:07:25,419
Everyone working at Prosperity

130
00:07:25,818 --> 00:07:27,378
is clearly priced,

131
00:07:27,458 --> 00:07:28,779
bound by contract,
and covered by insurance.

132
00:07:29,138 --> 00:07:30,258
I never forced anyone.

133
00:07:30,458 --> 00:07:32,378
If they want to quit,
they can leave anytime.

134
00:07:32,698 --> 00:07:33,698
As for you, Captain Xia,

135
00:07:34,779 --> 00:07:36,498
the prison villa is utterly filthy.

136
00:07:36,698 --> 00:07:37,698
Why don't you do something?

137
00:07:38,179 --> 00:07:39,179
I'm warning you.

138
00:07:40,578 --> 00:07:41,659
Don't get involved

139
00:07:41,979 --> 00:07:42,979
in Old Ghost's matters.

140
00:07:43,619 --> 00:07:44,619
Behave yourself.

141
00:07:45,539 --> 00:07:46,979
I'll be watching you.

142
00:07:48,498 --> 00:07:51,179
Xia Yuyan, Special Envoy
from the Central Inspection Ministry.

143
00:07:51,498 --> 00:07:52,539
She's familiar with Old Ghost,

144
00:07:52,539 --> 00:07:54,419
but their exact connection
remains unclear.

145
00:07:54,578 --> 00:07:55,578
Keep a close eye on her.

146
00:07:55,659 --> 00:07:56,659
Understood?

147
00:08:29,898 --> 00:08:30,898
Zhao Lu,

148
00:08:33,258 --> 00:08:34,378
why don't we just leave?

149
00:08:35,859 --> 00:08:36,979
Take me away from here.

150
00:08:38,779 --> 00:08:40,859
Go to a place where no one knows us.

151
00:08:43,618 --> 00:08:45,218
It will put our mind at ease.

152
00:09:16,458 --> 00:09:17,938
I want to take you away
more than anything.

153
00:09:20,539 --> 00:09:21,659
But Jiasheng...

154
00:09:24,379 --> 00:09:25,379
All right.

155
00:09:26,978 --> 00:09:27,978
Don't say anymore.

156
00:09:29,338 --> 00:09:30,338
I know.

157
00:09:50,698 --> 00:09:52,338
Mr. Tu, are you asleep?

158
00:09:52,539 --> 00:09:53,539
Speak up.

159
00:09:55,098 --> 00:09:57,779
You're fighting Lion tomorrow.

160
00:09:58,458 --> 00:10:00,618
He has never lost a match, after all.

161
00:10:01,218 --> 00:10:02,539
Why do you care about me so much?

162
00:10:05,419 --> 00:10:06,419
I think

163
00:10:06,899 --> 00:10:08,458
you're different from the others.

164
00:10:09,098 --> 00:10:10,539
You don't seem afraid of anything.

165
00:10:11,299 --> 00:10:12,299
I am.

166
00:10:14,419 --> 00:10:15,578
But what good does fear do?

167
00:10:20,738 --> 00:10:21,738
Shui,

168
00:10:22,059 --> 00:10:23,059
tell me

169
00:10:23,059 --> 00:10:24,338
about Lion's favorite moves.

170
00:11:23,168 --> 00:11:26,784
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

171
00:11:27,154 --> 00:11:31,139
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

172
00:11:35,895 --> 00:11:39,214
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

173
00:11:39,214 --> 00:11:44,299
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

174
00:11:47,888 --> 00:11:54,440
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

175
00:11:54,440 --> 00:12:02,861
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

176
00:12:02,861 --> 00:12:06,090
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

177
00:12:06,090 --> 00:12:09,285
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

178
00:12:09,285 --> 00:12:11,978
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

179
00:12:11,978 --> 00:12:16,595
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

180
00:12:20,506 --> 00:12:22,995
♪Burning alone♪

181
00:12:28,501 --> 00:12:34,870
♪The glory fades♪
